---
title: "transferInvestorPosition (LegionPreLiquidApprovedSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_auth: onlyLegion
    q_auth --> q_guards: whenNotPaused, whenSaleNotCanceled, whenSaleEnded, whenRefundPeriodIsOver, whenSaleResultsNotPublished
    q_guards --> q_verify_can_transfer: verifyCanTransferInvestorPosition(positionId)
    q_verify_can_transfer --> q_check_receiver: positionIdTo = investorPositionIds[to]
    q_check_receiver --> q_merge: positionIdTo != 0 (receiver has position)
    q_check_receiver --> q_transfer: positionIdTo == 0 (receiver has no position)
    q_merge --> q_verify_merge: verify receiver not settled/refunded and hasClaimedExcess
    q_verify_merge --> q_update_receiver: positionToUpdate.investedCapital += positionToBurn.investedCapital
    q_update_receiver --> q_update_rates: update cachedTokenAllocationRate and cachedInvestAmount
    q_update_rates --> q_delete: delete investorPositions[positionId]
    q_delete --> [*]: burnInvestorPosition(from)
    q_transfer --> [*]: transferInvestorPosition(from, to, positionId)

    note right of q_verify_can_transfer
        INV-001: position must not be settled, refunded, or have unclaimed excess
        INV-002: transfer only allowed before sale results published
        INV-003: merge adds capital and rates (additive combination)
    end note

    note right of q_verify_merge
        INV-004: receiver position must not be settled/refunded and must have claimed excess
        INV-005: burned position data is deleted from storage
    end note
